# Virtual try-on runtime (MediaPipe wasm + landmark models, ~46MB) and the
# converted try-on pieces are COMMITTED, same as vendor/ and public/build:
# the host has no Node, so anything not in git never reaches the site.
# The decision the old comment left open is now made — same-origin serving
# keeps the "nothing loads from third parties" privacy stance. Regenerate with:
#   cp node_modules/@mediapipe/tasks-vision/wasm/* public/mediapipe/wasm/
#   curl -Lo public/models/hand_landmarker.task \
#     https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/hand_landmarker/hand_landmarker/float16/1/hand_landmarker.task
#   curl -Lo public/models/face_landmarker.task \
#     https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-models/face_landmarker/face_landmarker/float16/1/face_landmarker.task
